#: src/addeditblog.cpp:132
msgid "You have to set the username, password and URL of your blog or website."
msgstr ""
"Du muttst Brukernaam, Passwoort un URL vun Dien Nettdaagbooksiet ingeven."

#: src/addeditblog.cpp:133
